  "content_en": "She threw him a handful of change and the quilt slid down without her noticing. Gu Mo saw that the petite shoulders were covered in spots and were horrible to look at. Was it all caused by him? Suddenly a flash of discomfort flashed across his face. Seeing him looking at her, Si Mian lowered his head and saw that he was a little exposed. He immediately pulled up the quilt and never took advantage of him. Then he scolded him, \"What are you looking at? If you look at me again, I will dig out your eyes and step on them like light bulbs.\" Gu Mo coughed twice, looked away, turned around, picked up his coat and put it on. Si Mian took advantage of this moment to quickly pick up the clothes on the ground, hiding under the quilt and making rustling movements. After putting on the clothes, he lifted the quilt and stepped on the ground. She immediately grimaced in pain. Damn it, I didn’t know it was her first time, but she was so hard. Si Mian looked at his back, lean yet muscular, and was stunned by it. He turned around, and their eyes met. Si Mian immediately came back to his senses, feeling extremely annoyed. How long had she still been in the mood to appreciate beauty? She had to accept the card so that the two of them could be reconciled and no one owed anything to the other. Although the taste she gave him last night was wonderful, she was still too young for him and not suitable for him. Moreover, if you encounter such a person, it will be troublesome, so it is better not to deal with it as much as possible. \"Put the card away. Later...\" Before Gu Mo could finish his words, Si Mian intercepted him. If he wanted to dump him, she had to dump him first. His innocence was gone. No matter how much he cried or made trouble, he couldn't turn back time. At this time, the momentum must be sufficient, and the formation will not lose even if the opponent loses. \"Let me tell you, what happened last night is like being bitten by a dog. You are not allowed to pester me. No one of us knows each other when we step out of this door.\" After saying that, she raised her head. Apart from her red eyes, she looked very good and her cheeks were rosy. Gu Mo was startled for a moment. She knew how to grab the conversation and said everything he wanted to say. But as long as no one gets in the way in the future, let her do it once. \"I hope you can keep your word.\" Si Mian glared at him, picked up the bank card and put it in his bag. The kind of bitter woman who doesn't want money for the sake of dignity is not suitable for her. His innocence has been given to him for free. If he doesn't want any more money, wouldn't he be a fool? This is regarded as various compensation fees, but if I unilaterally collected his money, wouldn't that mean that he was prostituted to me? no. Si Mian quickly took out a handful of money from his pocket and suddenly felt a little sweaty. He was so stupid that he didn't even have a twenty-yuan bill. They were all one yuan, fifty cents, and dimes. Who cares, just shock him first. She walked up to him, pulled open his collar, and stuffed a handful of change into it, \"Huh, your performance last night is only worth this. Remember, I was the one who prostituted you last night. If you dare to leak this matter, I will tell the world that you are a duck, and a duck with poor skills.\" After saying that, she ran away without waiting for Gu Mo's reaction. When the door closed, Si Mian breathed a sigh of relief. Gu Mo lowered his head and saw that his chest was stuffed full of change, and his forehead was covered with black lines. It was a shame she could think of it. If he really dared to glance at him, he would have been arrested and unable to get out. Si Mian ran out of the hotel in one breath and hid in the toilet of the nearby cafe. She was so exhausted that she sat on the toilet and gasped for air. Apart from a card, I didn't have a penny on my body. If I had known better, I wouldn't have given him so much money. At least I still had a dollar left for me to take the bus. It's fine now. There's no bank nearby, so she can go there to withdraw money. Now even if she likes Nian Xiuren, she won't engage in any drama of devotion. She has read too many novels and her head is stuck, so she would do such a thing. Si Mian regretted it to death now. On the way home, I didn't want to meet the man who I called my father but who failed to fulfill his father's responsibilities. When Si Dawei saw her, he came over with a smile on his face, \"Mianmian, I'm dad. How are you doing recently? Have you been promoted? I remember at the end of every month, you get paid, right?\" \"Dad, I'm just an intern now. I go to work just to learn experience. It's no different from working for free. What chance of promotion are there, and I have no money?\" Si Dawei held her hand, with a smile on his face. Trying to please her, \"Mianmian, isn't your stepfather rich? He won't give you pocket money, so why don't you give me some relief for your father? I haven't eaten for two days, you can't bear to see your father starve to death.\" Seeing the greed in Si Dawei's eyes, Si Mian felt very uncomfortable. She remembered that her father was not like this when she was a child, but at some point, her parents began to quarrel non-stop, always over money. In the end, my mother couldn't stand my father anymore, they divorced, and she stayed with her mother. \"Dad, I have hands and feet. There is no reason to take my stepfather's money. I am nowI'm really penniless, and I'm just a dragster. Do you really think that I am a young lady in that family? I have too much money to spend.\" She was already in a bad mood after what happened last night, but now that this happened again, she didn't even have the energy to be upset. In that family, she tried her best to earn the money she spent outside, without taking the Su family's money, so she I don’t have any savings at all. \"Mianmian, can you think of a way? How about you ask your mother for some money and treat it as if it was borrowed by dad. When dad finds a job, I will return it to you immediately.\" \"Dad, I really can't help it. You should find another way.\" Si Dawei was anxious and was about to kneel down. Si Mian's eyes widened and he immediately supported him, \"Dad, what are you doing?\" \"Get up, what are you talking about?\" \"You have to help dad no matter what this time, otherwise dad will really be cornered.\" Si Dawei's eyes were red and he looked miserable. Although he was wrong, he was still his father after all. Seeing him burst into tears made Si Mian feel sour. She really couldn't refuse. \"Let's go. I'll go to the bank to get some money for you.\" When Si Mian took out the bank card, Si Dawei grabbed it and saw the password on it. His eyes suddenly lit up, \"Mian Mian, daddy will keep the card for you first. This money is considered a loan from daddy, and I will definitely return it to you in the future. That's it, I'll leave first.\" After that, Si Dawei left in a hurry. Seeing him leaving without looking back, Si Mian's heart ached. He was her biological father, and even the card was taken away. She didn't think about how she would live her life in the future. Si Mian felt exhausted physically and mentally. Ji Du is about the same as her. Her daughter Su Xin was sent abroad to study very early and rarely came back a few times a year, so Si Mian and Su Song spent a lot of time together. But her mother was busy trying to please her son, and she often forgot that she also had a daughter named Si Mian. Otherwise, she would have been suffering from depression due to her growing up environment.",
